This file is a subset of noto_sans, made by "modustool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126, the characters U+00A0 to U+00FF, the characters U+20AC,
the characters that each process draws from the outlines, U+0100 to U+017F U+0391 to U+03A1 U+03A3 to U+03A9 U+03B1 to U+03C9 U+0400 to U+045F,
and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(196 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables; the 0 pair adjustments of its table kern between
these characters. The subset carries the name "Noto Sans LGC".
License of the source: SIL OFL 1.1, no Reserved Font Name.

